WEBVTT

00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:30.044
but what could be or what will be.

00:01:31.921 --> 00:01:34.590
As a business strategist
dealing with adults,

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:35.883
I still recommend play.

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:39.512
In fact, play in business
is not just possible,

00:01:39.512 --> 00:01:41.764
I’d argue that it’s essential

00:01:41.764 --> 00:01:43.015
and even urgent.

00:01:43.266 --> 00:01:44.267
And here’s why.

00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:50.148
Competitive advantage fades away
faster than any time in recent memory.

00:01:50.815 --> 00:01:52.358
In the 1980s,

00:01:52.358 --> 00:01:55.361
if you had a performance edge
over your competitors,

00:01:55.361 --> 00:01:59.407
you could reasonably expect to continue
being a leader for around 10 years,

00:01:59.407 --> 00:02:00.408
on average.